Generic single-database configuration for BugFlow.

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for the BugFlow database schema.

Usage:
  - Create a new migration:   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
  - Apply migrations:         alembic upgrade head
  - Rollback one migration:   alembic downgrade -1
  - View migration history:   alembic history

Configuration:
  - Database URL is read from app.config.DATABASE_URL (env var DATABASE_URL)
  - env.py loads the app's SQLAlchemy models (app.models.Base) for autogenerate support